OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA line of
OL,6,Fheavy showers will quickly pass this
OL,7,Fevening but lighter rain will persist
OL,8,Funtil around midnight. Then, clear
OL,9,Fspells and scattered showers. Very
OL,10,Fwindy throughout the night, with gales
OL,11,Ffor exposed coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA windy morning with coastal
OL,14,Fgales, and sunny spells with scattered
OL,15,Fshowers. Feeling cold in the strong
OL,16,Fwind, but this will gradually ease to
OL,17,Fbecome a breezy evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
