OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FOn
OL,6,FMonday, heavy rain will pass followed
OL,7,Fby strong winds and coastal gales.
OL,8,FWindy again throughout Tuesday, but
OL,9,Fbrighter with scattered showers. On
OL,10,FWednesday, bright and breezy with
OL,11,Fisolated showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
